  "body_html": "<h1>decisive_contraction</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem decisive_contraction [Fintype N] [Fintype A] {F : SWF N A} (h0 : ∃ x y z : A, x ≠ y ∧ x ≠ z ∧ y ≠ z) {C : Set N} (hCdec : IsDecisive F C) (hCcard : 2 ≤ C.ncard) (hU : SWF.Unanimity F) (hIIA : SWF.IIA F) : ∃ S : Set N, S.Nonempty ∧ S &lt; C ∧ IsDecisive F S</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SWF</li>\n<li>IsDecisive</li>\n<li>Unanimity</li>\n<li>IIA</li>\n<li>Profile.ext</li>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n</ul>",
